=== apogee chat
--- stdin
hello
/help
/models
/model
/model helper
again
/model root
/suite
/think
/think off
/think
/recall
/retriever
/retriever lexical
/rerank
/rerank off
/temperature warm
/max-tokens many
/permissions
/allow
/branch
/attachments
/detach nothing
/attach
/check
/title renamed
/system be brief
/compact
/play summarize-verify x
/symphonies
/nonsense
/exit
--- exit 0
--- stdout
ROOT<hello>
HELPER<again>
--- stderr
  /help                   List these commands
  /model [backend]        Show the backend answering, or switch to another
  /models                 List the configured backends
  /suite [name|off]       Show the suite and what its members hold, or switch to another (then --force, --warm) or off
  /system <text>          Replace the system prompt
  /temperature <number>   Set the sampling temperature
  /think [on|off|auto]    Show or set whether the model thinks first: on, off, or auto per question
  /max-tokens <number>    Cap each answer's length in tokens
  /compact                Summarise the conversation so far, to free context
  /title <name>           Rename this chat
  /retriever [mode]       Show or set how documents are searched: auto, lexical, vector or hybrid
  /rerank [backend]       Show or set the model that reranks search results, or off, or auto
  /branch [ref]           Show or set the branch under review: head, base..head, or off
  /capture [status|link]  Save this conversation as a knowledge record
  /check                  Have the suite's verifier check the last answer, once
  /attach <path>          Attach a file, folder or glob: inlined when it fits, retrieved when not (then --graph=code|off)
  /attachments            List what is attached
  /detach <name>          Detach an attachment
  /recall [on|off]        Show or set whether turns recall earlier chats
  /private                Never summarise this chat for recall
  /allow [tool|website]   Allow a tool or website for this chat; alone, list each answer
  /deny <tool|website>    Refuse a tool or website for this chat, without asking
  /revoke <tool|website>  Forget this chat's answer for a tool or website
  /permissions            List each tool's answer and where it comes from
  /exit                   Save and leave
  /quit                   Save and leave
  helper
* root
root
[apogee] switched to helper
[apogee] switched to root
[apogee] suite: none -- /suite <name> runs the chat under one
[apogee] thinking: on
[apogee] thinking: off
[apogee] recall: off
[rag] retriever: auto -- vector when the collection's vectors match the embedding backend, else lexical; hybrid only when asked
[rag] retriever set to lexical
[rag] rerank: following each collection's rerank: pin -- /rerank <backend>|off|auto
[rag] rerank set to off
[error] not a number: 'warm'
[error] not a number: 'many'
  no tool in this chat asks permission (--tools)
  no tool in this chat asks permission (--tools)
[apogee] review: off -- /branch <head>, <base>..<head>, or off
[apogee] nothing attached -- /attach <path>
[error] nothing attached as 'nothing' -- /attachments lists them
[error] /attach takes a file, a folder or a glob -- /attach <path> [--graph=code|off]
[error] check: no suite is active -- a check is one member of a suite checking another's work
[apogee] renamed
[apogee] system prompt updated
[apogee] history compacted
[error] unknown command '/play' -- /help lists them
[error] unknown command '/symphonies' -- /help lists them
[error] unknown command '/nonsense' -- /help lists them
