[apogee] suite: none -- /suite <name> runs the chat under one
=== apogee chat --suite duo
--- stdin
hi
/suite
/suite off
still here
/suite duo
/suite nope
/suite duo --warm
bye
--- exit 0
--- stdout
ROOT<hi>
ROOT<still here>
ROOT<bye>
--- stderr
[apogee] suite duo: no member holds memory on this machine
[apogee] suite: duo -- chat root · utility helper
footprint: suite duo
  root (chat): nothing held here
  helper (utility): nothing held here
  total: suite duo: no member holds memory on this machine
[apogee] suite off -- the roles follow the global pointers; the conversation stays on root
[apogee] suite duo -- chat root · utility helper
[apogee] suite duo: no member holds memory on this machine
[error] no suite named 'nope' (configured: duo)
[apogee] suite duo -- chat root · utility helper
[apogee] suite duo: no member holds memory on this machine
